1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:04,025
Ren: If your phone rings now, you just
rang a dinner bell.

2
00:00:04,695 --> 00:00:09,995
VALE & SON DISPATCH: The Quiet Hand. Part
three of ten: the kid on the roof.

3
00:00:10,315 --> 00:00:13,453
Ren: Six hours in. The van is out of gas.

4
00:00:14,123 --> 00:00:16,730
Ren: A dead gas station. Pumps first.

5
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,213
Ren: Quiet. Even the lamp hums.

6
00:00:20,883 --> 00:00:22,970
Ren: Three. Under the canopy.

7
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:24,374
Ren: One.

8
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:26,215
Ren: Two.

9
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:28,205
Ren: Three.

10
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,575
Ren: Pump seven. Empty.

11
00:00:32,245 --> 00:00:35,207
Ren: My phone is buzzing. Do not answer.

12
00:00:35,877 --> 00:00:39,249
Ren: Silent. Airplane mode. Now.

13
00:00:39,919 --> 00:00:43,801
Noor: Hey. Mister. Up here.

14
00:00:44,471 --> 00:00:48,095
Noor: Five hours up here. Three of them
down there.

15
00:00:48,765 --> 00:00:52,035
Noor: I know a shortcut. You killed my
guards. Deal?

16
00:00:52,705 --> 00:00:54,371
Ren: Three moves. A deal.

17
00:00:55,041 --> 00:00:58,095
Noor: Wait. How do you know the name The
Quiet?

18
00:00:58,765 --> 00:01:05,487
VALE & SON DISPATCH: Part three of ten, The
Quiet Hand. Next: the tunnel. Follow for part four.

